        <mxCell id="FiZMqvlng4lK8YH4NTxv-1027" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;Domain rules&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;notification.type — allowed values (contracts/README.md §13.1):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;REQUEST_CREATED&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;NEW_MATCHING_REQUEST&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_UPDATED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_ASSIGNED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_ASSIGNED_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_COLLECTED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_COLLECTED_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_DELIVERED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_DELIVERED_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_CANCELLED_BY_RESIDENT_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_CANCELLED_BY_RESIDENT_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_CANCELLED_BY_VOLUNTEER_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_CANCELLED_BY_VOLUNTEER_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_MISSED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ASSIGNMENT_MISSED_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_CANCELLED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;REQUEST_EXPIRED_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ECOPOINTS_AWARDED_ON_DELIVERY_RESIDENT&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ECOPOINTS_AWARDED_ON_DELIVERY_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;ECOPOINTS_AWARDED_ON_ASSIGNMENT_CANCELLATION_VOLUNTEER&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;assignment.end_reason — allowed non-NULL values (§12.1–12.5):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Delivered; Resident_Cancelled; Volunteer_Cancelled; Missed_Pickup. NULL while the assignment is active.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;status_change.status — allowed values (§12.1):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Open; Assigned; Collected; Delivered; Cancelled; Expired; Missed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;status_change.reason:&lt;/b&gt; optional free text explaining the status change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Additional constraints:&lt;/b&gt; at most one unfinished assignment per request; one delivery per assignment; one reschedule per missed request; resident/volunteer EcoPoints XOR; request/award notification reference rules; pickup_window.start_hour 0–23.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;BR55 — At most one resident EcoPoints award&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;and one volunteer EcoPoints award per assignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Enforce using partial UNIQUE indexes on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;assignment_id, separately for resident and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;volunteer awards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;BR9 — A volunteer may have at most 3 preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;postal codes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Enforce using concurrency-safe application&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;transaction logic or a database trigger.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;BR32 — A pickup request may have at most&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;3 active pickup windows (is_active = TRUE).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Inactive historical windows are retained.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Enforce using concurrency-safe application&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;transaction logic or a database trigger.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;terms_acceptance.type — Allowed values:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;AT_RESIDENT_REGISTRATION_OR_ACTIVATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;AT_VOLUNTEER_REGISTRATION_OR_ACTIVATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;AT_RESIDENT_REQUEST_CREATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;AT_VOLUNTEER_ACCEPTANCE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="967" width="2119" x="917" y="3433" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FiZMqvlng4lK8YH4NTxv-1028" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;ITEM_CATEGORY — Reference data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;category_id | name | waste_type | standard_weight_kg&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;laptops | Computers/Laptops | Computers | 2.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;desktops | Computers/Desktops | Computers | 8.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;monitors | Monitors | Displays | 5.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;tvs | Televisions | Displays | 12.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;phones | Phones | Mobile Devices | 0.20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;tablets | Tablets | Mobile Devices | 0.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;printers | Printers | Printers | 6.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;small-appliances | Small Appliances | Small Appliances | 3.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;cables-chargers | Cables and Chargers | Accessories | 0.30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
